# Powers the "nearby businesses" list in the homepage site-checker tool.
# Google Cloud Console: enable "Places API", set up billing, create a key,
# and restrict it to the Places API only. Never prefix this with
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ — it must stay server-only. Without it, the site checker
# still works; it just shows the SEO score and hides the nearby list.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
